raw model output may incidentally reproduce -- that text remains subject to its
original rights holders and to the takedown procedure in DATA.md.

DATA.md is authoritative for component-by-component terms and for the full
provenance chain. Hosting platforms that detect a single licence from this file
will label the whole repository "MIT"; that label is too broad, and this note is
here because the label cannot be corrected from inside the file it reads.

